RF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows March to April came in under 90% of normal in 43 of 75 years on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids. On that middle, September to October 2025 ran 48% of normal and November to December 2025 ran 45%. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 163% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 11541 had its driest year in 2011 at 45%.</p>"}
